<p>Every product update we do is more useful in person than on a Zoom — designers ask better questions when they have the actual sample board in their hands and a Pronorm display six feet away. Colorado Modern Kitchens has one of the strongest Pronorm showrooms in our territory, and the conversation we had at their island is the kind we want to be having with every dealer this year.</p>

<p>If you're a Pinnacle Sales dealer and you'd like the same walkthrough — dealer portal demo, American depths Q&amp;A, and the PG3 sample boards in your showroom — get on your territory rep's calendar. We'll bring the boards. (And, when she's not in the office, the dog.)</p>

